# A release checklist that credits a page with a reader it has not got

## The documentation matches what the build produces

Nothing decides this yet, and what is missing is a decision rather than a check.
The issue is #62.

The pages read against the tree on every run rather than trusted are
`docs/alpha.md`, `docs/beta.md` and `docs/gamma.md`.

Two of the three are right, so this trips the direction it is for and no other.
